---
/* "Tell us who you're looking for": the front door for someone who has a story and one thing in their hand, not a place name.
   Phase 0 of docs/story-guide-plan-2026-11-08.md: a sentence with blanks, an animated line between two places with a year slider
   and who held the ground, and a plan built by rules from the Atlas's own files. No AI, no account, nothing saved or sent. */
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { u } from "../lib/url.js";
---
<Base
  title="Tell us who you're looking for"
  eyebrow="Start from the story, not the place"
  dek="Say it the way you would say it to a relative: who, from where, to where, and what you hold. You get their journey on the map and a short plan of what to look at first."
  description="Fill in one sentence about an ancestor, from where to where and what you hold, and see the journey on a map with who held the ground in each year, plus a short ordered plan of the registers and sources to look at first.">

  <form id="lf-form" class="lf-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
    <p class="lf-sentence">
      I want to find out about my
      <select id="lf-rel" aria-label="Who they are to you">
        <option>great-grandfather</option><option>grandfather</option><option>father</option><option>great-great-grandfather</option>
        <option>grandmother</option><option>great-grandmother</option><option>mother</option><option>ancestor</option><option>relative</option>
      </select>
      <input id="lf-name" class="lf-in lf-short" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="name, if you know it" aria-label="Their name, if you know it" />
      from
      <span class="lf-pick"><input id="lf-from" class="lf-in lf-place" type="text" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="lf-from-list" aria-autocomplete="list" placeholder="where they started" aria-label="Where they started; old names are accepted" />
        <ul id="lf-from-list" class="lf-list" role="listbox" hidden></ul></span>
      who came to
      <span class="lf-pick"><input id="lf-to" class="lf-in lf-place" type="text" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="lf-to-list" aria-autocomplete="list" placeholder="where they arrived" aria-label="Where they arrived" />
        <ul id="lf-to-list" class="lf-list" role="listbox" hidden></ul></span>
      around
      <input id="lf-left" class="lf-in lf-year" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="4" placeholder="year" aria-label="About the year they left or arrived" />.
      They were born about
      <input id="lf-born" class="lf-in lf-year" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="4" placeholder="year" aria-label="About the year they were born, if you know it" />.
    </p>
    <fieldset class="lf-holds">
      <legend>All I have is</legend>
      <label><input type="radio" name="holds" value="photo" checked /> a photo</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="holds" value="document" /> a document</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="holds" value="letter" /> a letter</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="holds" value="story" /> the family story</label>
    </fieldset>
    <p class="lf-actions"><button id="lf-go" class="lf-go" type="button">Show me their journey and what to do first</button>
      <span id="lf-status" class="lf-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></p>
    <p class="lf-fine">Only the places and years matter; every box is optional. The page reads the Atlas's own files in your browser: nothing you type is sent anywhere or kept.
      Please do not enter details of anyone who may be alive.</p>
  </form>

  <div id="lf-out" class="lf-out" hidden>
    <section id="lf-journey" class="lf-journey" aria-labelledby="lf-h-journey" hidden>
      <h2 id="lf-h-journey">Their journey</h2>
      <div id="lf-map" class="lf-map" role="img" aria-label="Map of the journey from the place they started to the place they arrived"></div>
      <div id="lf-time" class="lf-time">
        <button id="lf-play" class="lf-play" type="button">▶ Play</button>
        <label class="lf-slide"><span class="lf-sr">Year</span><input id="lf-year" type="range" min="1800" max="1900" step="1" value="1800" /></label>
        <output id="lf-yearout" class="lf-yearout" for="lf-year"></output>
      </div>
      <div id="lf-cap" class="lf-capbox"></div>
      <p class="lf-fine">The dashed line joins the two places in date order. It is not the route they took: the Atlas does not know that, and neither does anyone without a ship's list.</p>
      <div id="lf-moments" class="lf-moments"></div>
      <div id="lf-names"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="lf-planbox" aria-labelledby="lf-h-plan">
      <h2 id="lf-h-plan">What to do first</h2>
      <p class="lf-lead">Each step names registers and sources the Atlas holds. A step that says the Atlas lists none is a gap in the Atlas, not a gap in the record.</p>
      <ol id="lf-plan" class="lf-plan"></ol>
      <div id="lf-family" class="lf-family" hidden>
        <p class="lf-fam-h">Ready to begin?</p>
        <p class="lf-lead">Start a research family and the registers and sources above are added as planned, so you can mark them off as you look.</p>
        <p><button id="lf-family-btn" class="lf-go" type="button">Start this research family</button> <span id="lf-family-out" class="lf-status" role="status"></span></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script is:inline src={u("/js/atlas-summary.js")}></script>
  <script is:inline src={u("/js/shard-key.js")}></script>
  <script is:inline src={u("/js/story-engine.js")}></script>
  <script is:inline src={u("/js/looking-for.js")}></script>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .lf-form { max-width: 62rem; }
  .lf-sentence { font: 400 clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px)/2.5 var(--serif); color: var(--ink); margin: 6px 0 14px; }
  .lf-in, .lf-form select { font: 500 .8em/1.2 var(--sans); color: var(--ink); background: var(--panel); border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; padding: 4px 8px; min-width: 0; }
  .lf-in::placeholder { color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 400; }
  .lf-in.is-set { background: var(--accent-wash); }
  .lf-in:focus-visible, .lf-form select:focus-visible, .lf-go:focus-visible, .lf-play:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent-2); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .lf-short { width: 11em; } .lf-place { width: 12.5em; } .lf-year { width: 4.6em; text-align: center; }
  .lf-pick { position: relative; display: inline-block; }
  .lf-list { position: absolute; z-index: 20; top: 100%; left: 0; min-width: 100%; width: max-content; max-width: min(24rem, 86vw); margin: 2px 0 0; padding: 4px; list-style: none; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18); font: 400 15px/1.3 var(--sans); }
  .lf-opt { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
  .lf-opt span { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13px; }
  .lf-opt[aria-selected=true], .lf-opt:hover { background: var(--accent-wash); }
  .lf-holds { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 18px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; align-items: center; }
  .lf-holds legend { float: left; margin-right: 16px; padding: 0; font: 400 clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px)/1.6 var(--serif); }
  .lf-holds label { font: 500 16px/1 var(--sans); padding: 9px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--panel); cursor: pointer; }
  .lf-holds label:has(input:checked) { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .lf-holds input { accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .lf-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: center; margin: 4px 0 8px; }
  .lf-go { font: 600 17px/1 var(--sans); background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px 22px; cursor: pointer; }
  .lf-go:hover { background: var(--accent-2); }
  .lf-status { font: 500 15px/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); } .lf-status.lf-bad { color: var(--brick); }
  .lf-fine { font: 400 14px/1.5 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); max-width: var(--measure); }

  .lf-out { margin-top: 30px; }
  .lf-out h2 { font: 500 26px/1.2 var(--serif); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .lf-journey { margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .lf-map { height: clamp(300px, 46vh, 460px); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .lf-time { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; margin: 12px 0 6px; max-width: 46rem; }
  .lf-time[hidden], .lf-play[hidden] { display: none; }
  .lf-play { flex: none; font: 600 15px/1 var(--sans); min-width: 6.5em; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--accent); color: var(--accent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 11px 14px; cursor: pointer; }
  .lf-slide { flex: 1; min-width: 0; } .lf-slide input { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .lf-yearout { flex: none; font: 600 22px/1 var(--serif); min-width: 2.6em; text-align: right; color: var(--ink); }
  .lf-sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); }
  .lf-capbox { display: grid; gap: 8px; max-width: var(--measure); margin: 6px 0 10px; }
  .lf-capline { font: 400 17px/1.45 var(--sans); padding: 10px 14px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); background: var(--panel); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }
  .lf-regime { color: var(--ink-2); } .lf-filed { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 3px; }
  .lf-moments h4, .lf-names h4 { font: 600 12px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin: 18px 0 8px; }
  .lf-moments ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; max-width: var(--measure); } .lf-moments li { margin: 0 0 5px; }

  .lf-capline { overflow: hidden; }
  .lf-flag { float: right; width: 44px; height: 29px; margin: 0 0 4px 12px; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 3px; background: var(--panel); }
  .lf-leader { font-style: italic; }
  .lf-now { margin-top: 6px; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--accent-wash); border-left: 3px solid var(--tagc, var(--accent)); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .lf-now-epidemic, .lf-ev-epidemic .lf-tag { --tagc: #8a3b6e; } .lf-now-famine, .lf-ev-famine .lf-tag { --tagc: #a8741a; }
  .lf-now-war, .lf-ev-war .lf-tag { --tagc: #b3452e; } .lf-now-genocide, .lf-ev-genocide .lf-tag, .lf-ev-massacre .lf-tag, .lf-ev-atrocity .lf-tag { --tagc: #7a1f1f; } .lf-ev-displacement .lf-tag { --tagc: #1f5c6b; }
  .lf-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--tagc, var(--accent)); color: #fff; font: 600 12px/1.6 var(--sans); }
  .lf-events { list-style: none; padding-left: 0 !important; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .lf-ev { padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 3px solid var(--tagc, var(--accent)); background: var(--panel); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }
  .lf-names { max-width: var(--measure); } .lf-forms { margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 18px; } .lf-forms li { margin: 0 0 5px; } .lf-names .cap { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; }
  .lf-lead { max-width: var(--measure); color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .lf-plan { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 14px; max-width: 62rem; counter-reset: none; }
  .lf-step { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px 14px; }
  .lf-step h3 { font: 500 21px/1.3 var(--serif); margin: 0 0 4px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; }
  .lf-num { flex: none; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font: 600 15px/1 var(--sans); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .lf-why { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: var(--measure); }
  .lf-items { margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 20px; max-width: var(--measure); } .lf-items li { margin: 0 0 5px; }
  .lf-ask, .lf-not { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; max-width: var(--measure); }
  .lf-family { margin-top: 22px; padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--accent-wash); border-radius: 12px; max-width: 62rem; }
  .lf-fam-h { font: 500 21px/1.3 var(--serif); margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .lf-ask b { color: var(--accent); } .lf-not b { color: var(--brick); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lf-sentence { line-height: 2.7; }
    .lf-short, .lf-place { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; }
    .lf-pick { display: block; }
    .lf-time { flex-wrap: wrap; } .lf-slide { flex-basis: 100%; order: 3; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lf-out * { scroll-behavior: auto; transition: none; animation: none; } }
</style>
